    "Full reasons and application have not been independently checked; retained passages are selected extracts.",
    "Complete subsequent treatment remains unknown.",
    "Scenario-seven reconciliation and a complete customer classifier remain unresolved.",
    "Candidate case manifests give the same source hash for both judgments, while the supplied source-file records give distinct hashes; provenance requires reconciliation.",
    "Rendered DOCX fidelity is unverified.",
    "No actual Product Provider facts or sufficient applicable fulfillment standard are supplied. Candidate rules or solver acceptance cannot establish legal truth."
  ]
